{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19261","headline":"送令狐相公自仆射出镇南梁 · 刘禹锡","name":"送令狐相公自仆射出镇南梁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夏木正阴成，戎装出帝京。\n沾襟辞阙泪，回首别乡情。\n云树褒中路，风烟汉上城。\n前旌传谷去，後骑踏桥声。\n久领鸳行重，无嫌虎绶轻。\n终提一麾去，再入福苍生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19261.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19261","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}